                },
                "message": "🐛 Build the emureader module in the Elpaca source dir and link it\n\nElpaca's builds dir only holds the files selected by :files, so it has no\nMakefile and `emureader-build' failed with \"No rule to make target 'module'\".\nBuild the module in the source dir before linking and link the Makefile,\nrender/ and the module into the builds dir.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiBWtETz7fdpswkrh5P",
